1
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,390
Let's go.

2
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:11,390
I have something to tell you.

3
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,360
What have you done?

4
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:30,940
What have you done?

5
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:39,090
What on earth have you done?

6
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:45,080
What are you doing?

7
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:47,110
You took the words right out of my mouth.

8
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,710
Go.

9
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,340
Don't go.

10
00:00:55,020 --> 00:01:00,870
Don't give her orders in front of me.

11
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:05,510
You have no right to order me.

12
00:01:06,010 --> 00:01:07,750
Really?

13
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,450
Do you really think so?

14
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:17,250
Do Hoon!

15
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,550
Are you crazy?

16
00:01:26,550 --> 00:01:29,440
Why are you doing this?

17
00:01:29,850 --> 00:01:31,790
Why?

18
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:36,230
What do you want to do?

19
00:01:49,730 --> 00:01:51,750
It sucks.

20
00:02:04,150 --> 00:02:05,640
Do Hoon, are you okay?

21
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:10,760
How can I make you listen to me?

22
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:16,020
Jo Min Hyuk! He has known our relationship since the beginning.

23
00:02:16,380 --> 00:02:17,430
What are you talking about?

24
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:20,130
He keeps on doing this even though he knew our relationship.

25
00:02:20,130 --> 00:02:22,540
Impossible.

26
00:02:22,820 --> 00:02:25,170
He made us to meet each other on purpose?

27
00:02:25,170 --> 00:02:28,400
I told you not to see him.

28
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,970
Hello.

29
00:03:21,750 --> 00:03:23,530
If I weren't here, you'd follow him anywhere?

30
00:03:23,530 --> 00:03:24,680
What are you wearing?

31
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,590
I had no choice. He forced me to do it.

32
00:03:26,590 --> 00:03:31,300
If he asked, would you sell yourself?

33
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:53,660
Eight of 12 votes voted in favor

34
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:57,000
of the dismissal of the CEO, Jo Min Hyuk.

35
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,230
You!

36
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:19,160
What are you doing?

37
00:05:19,690 --> 00:05:21,970
I told you to stay with Min Hyuk.

38
00:05:21,970 --> 00:05:25,510
Where were you when Min Hyuk got himself in trouble, you idiot!

39
00:05:25,510 --> 00:05:27,010
I'm sorry.

40
00:05:27,010 --> 00:05:28,550
Sorry can't deal with anything.

41
00:05:28,550 --> 00:05:30,570
Stop it, dad!

42
00:05:33,330 --> 00:05:36,410
He was doing what I told him to do.

43
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:41,640
They have approved your dismissal.

44
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:42,800
What are you talking about?

45
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:48,090
Se Yeon is the one of those who vote in favor of your dismissal.

46
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,470
- Get out! - Father.

47
00:05:50,470 --> 00:05:52,780
Get out, you bastard!

48
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:33,110
You did this?

49
00:06:33,330 --> 00:06:36,320
Yoo Jung isn't enough? So you hit Do Hoon?

50
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:39,640
You're not apologizing after what you've done?

51
00:06:39,690 --> 00:06:42,910
I told you not to side with him in front of me.

52
00:06:43,130 --> 00:06:44,620
Apologize?

53
00:06:45,140 --> 00:06:46,830
He's the one who should apologize.

54
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:48,600
Why should I apologize?

55
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,730
Why?

56
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:54,220
- Jo Min Hyuk! - Why?

57
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:57,300
What are you doing? Jo Min Hyuk!

58
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,580
Do Hoon! Let's go!

59
00:07:07,910 --> 00:07:11,310
If you want the hotel, why didn't you tell me?

60
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:16,070
I could've given it to you as a wedding present.

61
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:22,170
I don't want the hotel.

62
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:28,830
Not only did you bring another woman to a party,

63
00:07:28,830 --> 00:07:31,090
you also started a fight because of her.

64
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:32,500
When can you grow up?

65
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:35,840
Do you know how embarrassed I am?

66
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:38,580
Se Yeon, President Jo might hear you.

67
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:41,500
Shut up!

68
00:07:43,860 --> 00:07:45,450
Let's go.

69
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:04,840
If he remained in his position,

70
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:07,780
his career in hotel might be ended soon.

71
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:15,170
Is that why you took the lead in ousting Min Hyuk?

72
00:08:15,170 --> 00:08:20,340
I know for sure that two of them support you all the times.

73
00:08:20,530 --> 00:08:23,670
We can bring Min Hyuk back when we have a new board members next year.

74
00:08:23,670 --> 00:08:27,920
That's none of your business.

75
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:30,990
I'll take care of it.

76
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:41,210
Look, we can't let others know that they support us.

77
00:08:41,210 --> 00:08:48,530
Check out who found it out.

78
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:50,060
Yes, sir!

79
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:54,160
What happened to your mouth?

80
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:57,110
Nothing.

81
00:09:03,570 --> 00:09:06,360
I don't think I paid for what I did.

82
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:10,630
I won't forget it as long as I live.

83
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:13,320
How can I forget?

84
00:09:14,860 --> 00:09:17,730
I'm ashamed of

85
00:09:18,790 --> 00:09:21,210
what I did to that woman.

86
00:09:21,210 --> 00:09:23,740
Did you really see her and walk away?

87
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:27,260
Yes! I did it.

88
00:09:27,290 --> 00:09:30,520
What do you want?

89
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:36,320
Haven't you tortured me enough?

90
00:09:38,690 --> 00:09:44,430
Crazy girl. What have you done?

91
00:09:59,430 --> 00:10:05,910
Kwang Soo. How can this happen?

92
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:12,380
They were at the coffee shop together.

93
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:15,120
Whether they were in the same car...

94
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:17,910
Continue your investigation.

95
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:23,270
After he proposed to her, they went home separately?

96
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:27,860
Does that make sense?

97
00:10:56,020 --> 00:11:00,650
I don't think he will let it slide this time.

98
00:11:01,110 --> 00:11:03,260
No matter how obnoxious he is,

99
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:06,700
we can't ignore Se Gwang's power.

100
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:11,280
He wants you to apologize in person.

101
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,620
Apologize to him tomorrow.

102
00:11:14,290 --> 00:11:16,520
Apologize.

103
00:11:17,990 --> 00:11:20,590
I'll apologize to him.

104
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:28,320
But he should apologize to the girl that he humiliated first.

105
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,750
Who is that girl?

106
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:36,550
Someone I care about.

107
00:11:40,650 --> 00:11:46,880
You have to be careful

108
00:12:02,300 --> 00:12:03,900
What's this?

109
00:12:04,190 --> 00:12:06,090
You're a substandard product.

110
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:10,290
She'd do anything for money, right?

111
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:12,130
Don't prentend to be noble.

112
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:15,910
Go buy a clothes.

113
00:12:16,190 --> 00:12:18,180
She'd do anything.

114
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:20,520
Only for me.

115
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:32,850
Aren't you going to tell me what happened yesterday?

116
00:12:50,270 --> 00:12:54,290
Keeping your mouth shut isn't the solution.

117
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:59,260
You're smiling again. Something must've happened.

118
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:03,730
Get some rest.

119
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,540
You had a fever yesterday.

120
00:13:05,740 --> 00:13:08,630
I need to keep this job.

121
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:12,390
Is that yours?

122
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,630
See you later.

123
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:44,590
Driver!

124
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,500
Driver!

125
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,690
Kang Yoo Jung!

126
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:56,980
Jo Min Hyuk! He knows about our relationship.

127
00:13:57,140 --> 00:14:00,350
He keeps on doing this even though he knew our relationship.

128
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:05,790
What is it now?

129
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,620
What do you want from me?

130
00:14:10,270 --> 00:14:12,580
When are you going to stop?

131
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:15,320
When can you tell me the truth?

132
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:16,800
What are you talking about?

133
00:14:16,950 --> 00:14:21,280
What are your trying to protect?

134
00:14:22,430 --> 00:14:25,950
You and Ahn Do Hoon. What are you hiding?

135
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:40,280
Excuse me!

136
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:44,050
I killed someone.

137
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:46,360
It was a hit-and-run.

138
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:49,240
I hit someone and ran away.

139
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,750
Hey!

140
00:14:52,090 --> 00:14:55,760
I said it! Are you happy?

141
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,830
Isn't this what you wanted?

142
00:14:59,030 --> 00:14:59,550
Driver!

143
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,290
Isn't it enough?

144
00:15:01,490 --> 00:15:04,690
You want to see me dead in front of you?

145
00:15:06,910 --> 00:15:08,890
Let me go!

146
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:10,310
Pull yourself together!

147
00:15:11,290 --> 00:15:14,590
Let me go!

148
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:18,320
Let me go!

149
00:15:18,660 --> 00:15:19,610
Let me go!

150
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:22,820
Are you crazy?

151
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:27,150
Yes, I'm crazy.

152
00:15:52,570 --> 00:15:54,370
Kang Yoo Jung!

153
00:15:58,980 --> 00:16:00,740
Are you crazy?

154
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:46,330
Kwang Soo! Can you believe her?

155
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:55,880
She isn't even afraid of death.

156
00:16:57,670 --> 00:16:59,990
What is it that she wants to protect so badly?

157
00:17:01,100 --> 00:17:03,320
I'll get the car.

158
00:17:05,910 --> 00:17:07,580
No.

159
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,790
I'm good.

160
00:17:43,650 --> 00:17:45,840
I have nothing to say to you.

161
00:17:46,230 --> 00:17:48,200
Tell Min Hyuk to come and apologize to me.

162
00:17:48,370 --> 00:17:51,110
Jo Min Hyuk won't come.

163
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:55,320
He's going to hide behind his lawyer?

164
00:17:56,910 --> 00:17:59,130
Get out.

165
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:03,400
Don't send that article to the media.

166
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:08,980
In this day and age, a company can never control the media.

167
00:18:09,170 --> 00:18:11,880
Don't be so modest.

168
00:18:12,220 --> 00:18:17,040
If you send it the media, then it would be a public opinion.

169
00:18:24,570 --> 00:18:27,420
The even you cancelled in K Hotel

170
00:18:27,650 --> 00:18:29,750
will continute to hold.

171
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:34,520
Who do you think I am?

172
00:18:34,700 --> 00:18:39,600
You're the next CEO of the Segwang Corporation.

173
00:18:41,020 --> 00:18:44,220
Open the envelope first.

174
00:19:01,370 --> 00:19:02,610
What the heck is this?

175
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:05,840
I guess it's not enough for you

176
00:19:06,150 --> 00:19:08,340
to just publish some gossip news of Jo Min Hyuk.

177
00:19:23,050 --> 00:19:24,480
Hey!

178
00:19:28,610 --> 00:19:30,190
Yes?

179
00:19:30,390 --> 00:19:32,530
Have you ever lost an argument?

180
00:19:33,090 --> 00:19:34,710
So far, no.

181
00:19:35,540 --> 00:19:38,740
You'll win all your cases when you become a prosecutor.

182
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,970
I hope so.

183
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:42,790
Do you think you'll still help me if I'm in need?

184
00:19:42,950 --> 00:19:45,130
I'll help those who have no money and no power.

185
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:46,810
What about those who have money and power?

186
00:19:46,970 --> 00:19:49,740
They'll be able to take care of themselves.

187
00:19:50,630 --> 00:19:53,720
What if you pretend that you don't know me?

188
00:20:00,130 --> 00:20:03,730
You can show me this.

189
00:20:03,730 --> 00:20:06,820
I'll help you.

190
00:20:40,230 --> 00:20:47,810
As much as you hate to see me, I sufferd a lot facing you.

191
00:20:48,730 --> 00:20:52,330
I don't want to see you again.

192
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:36,470
It's not your fault.

193
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:43,560
What happened to Min Hyuk isn't your fault.

194
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:47,310
You scared me sometimes.

195
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:53,440
How can you know what I was thinking about just by my expression?

196
00:21:54,190 --> 00:21:57,600
Yes. I shouldn't have done that.

197
00:21:57,600 --> 00:21:58,730
Have you eaten?

198
00:21:58,730 --> 00:22:03,550
Why do you ask? Can't you guess?

199
00:22:22,210 --> 00:22:26,720
I'm paying you to work for my hotel,

200
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:30,950
not to flirt with my fiancee.

201
00:22:30,950 --> 00:22:33,680
It shouldn't concern you who I go out with.

202
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:35,940
You said I could date anyone

203
00:22:35,940 --> 00:22:40,260
as long as I marry you according to the contract.

204
00:22:40,260 --> 00:22:43,320
It depends on who you are dating with.

205
00:22:44,120 --> 00:22:47,050
You should at leaast date with someone of equal status.

206
00:23:00,830 --> 00:23:06,580
Never mind what he said. He won't mind it as well.

207
00:23:06,580 --> 00:23:08,030
Se Yeon.

208
00:23:08,030 --> 00:23:14,310
Where do you want to eat?

209
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:31,110
This smell might ruin your beautiful clothes.

210
00:23:31,110 --> 00:23:36,510
You're the only girl that Do Hoon has brought here.

211
00:23:36,510 --> 00:23:38,190
She's my colleague.

212
00:23:38,190 --> 00:23:40,420
Give it to me. I'll do it.

213
00:23:40,420 --> 00:23:43,770
I dried it myself.

214
00:23:43,770 --> 00:23:48,060
I put the ingredients after frying them, so it should be delicious.

215
00:23:48,060 --> 00:23:49,500
It looks delicious.

216
00:23:49,500 --> 00:23:52,480
- Thank you. - Enjoy your meal.

217
00:23:52,800 --> 00:23:57,120
Wow! You have long fingers.

218
00:23:57,120 --> 00:23:59,370
So beautiful.

219
00:23:59,370 --> 00:24:01,480
What do you do?

220
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:06,120
Are you a lawyer?

221
00:24:06,120 --> 00:24:10,140
No. I'm a painter.

222
00:24:10,140 --> 00:24:12,120
A painter.

223
00:24:12,120 --> 00:24:16,740
No wonder you have a unique temperament.

224
00:24:17,970 --> 00:24:21,090
Where do you live?

225
00:24:21,090 --> 00:24:22,630
What does your father do?

226
00:24:22,630 --> 00:24:24,640
Mother.

227
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:27,360
We're here to eat dinner.

228
00:24:27,360 --> 00:24:29,230
Sorry.

229
00:24:29,230 --> 00:24:31,090
I shouldn't have bothered you two.

230
00:24:31,090 --> 00:24:34,280
I don't think she knows how to eat this.

231
00:24:34,280 --> 00:24:37,770
I'll help her out.

232
00:24:43,610 --> 00:24:46,950
It's delicious. Thank you.

233
00:24:46,950 --> 00:24:49,720
Enjoy your meal.

234
00:24:55,570 --> 00:25:00,900
Min Hyuk, start visiting our restaurant branches tomorrow.

235
00:25:00,900 --> 00:25:03,450
Doing something like that might help you.

236
00:25:03,450 --> 00:25:06,310
You just give me a restaurant and ask me to step aside.

237
00:25:06,310 --> 00:25:09,760
You should be satisfied with that.

238
00:25:09,760 --> 00:25:14,080
You bring this on yourself.

239
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:17,990
It's Ahn Do Hoon who clane up the mess for you.

240
00:25:17,990 --> 00:25:19,890
Don't you feel ashamed of that?

241
00:25:19,890 --> 00:25:20,650
Father!

242
00:25:20,650 --> 00:25:23,170
I'm done taking care of you.

243
00:25:23,170 --> 00:25:27,190
You should depend on yourself from now on.

244
00:25:27,500 --> 00:25:29,490
Honey, don't you think

245
00:25:29,490 --> 00:25:32,640
you should give more shares to Min Joo?

246
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:36,680
How can they kick people out just like that?

247
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:39,480
If you want to come back to the hotel next year,

248
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:42,700
improve the performance of this restaurant.

249
00:25:42,700 --> 00:25:45,740
Why don't you run it for my brother?

250
00:25:45,740 --> 00:25:47,410
You're way smarter than him.

251
00:25:47,410 --> 00:25:48,670
Min Joo!

252
00:25:48,670 --> 00:25:50,640
What?

253
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:52,670
Min Hyuk would be happy about that.

254
00:25:52,670 --> 00:25:55,450
He could idle about as he wishes.

255
00:25:57,370 --> 00:26:01,430
Honey! Honey!

256
00:26:03,690 --> 00:26:06,670
I know my father.

257
00:26:06,670 --> 00:26:10,260
I don't think he just hires people without checking.

258
00:26:10,260 --> 00:26:12,080
So?

259
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:15,570
I'm sure you did a thorough background check.

260
00:26:15,570 --> 00:26:21,020
Give me the all the inforamtion you got regarding Ahn Do Hoon.

261
00:26:26,950 --> 00:26:30,690
Aren't you going home?

262
00:26:30,690 --> 00:26:35,860
I'm waiting for Yoo Jung.

263
00:26:36,630 --> 00:26:38,740
Yoo Jung!

264
00:26:40,250 --> 00:26:43,660
How come you didn't come to work?

265
00:26:43,660 --> 00:26:45,040
What happened?

266
00:26:45,040 --> 00:26:46,490
You said you were going to work.

267
00:26:46,490 --> 00:26:49,000
I told him that you were sick,

268
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,670
but if you miss work again...

269
00:26:50,670 --> 00:26:51,750
Sorry.

270
00:26:51,750 --> 00:26:53,110
I'm sorry, Hae Ri.

271
00:26:53,110 --> 00:26:55,920
You've been acting weird since yesterday.

272
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:58,860
What's going on?

273
00:26:58,860 --> 00:27:02,310
Tell me.

274
00:27:03,910 --> 00:27:07,100
She's driving me crazy.

275
00:27:07,100 --> 00:27:10,170
I guess I should've known. She won't talk.

276
00:27:10,170 --> 00:27:14,600
If Yoo Jung decides not to talk, that's it.

277
00:27:19,050 --> 00:27:23,330
What? Did you come with my boss' secretary?

278
00:27:23,330 --> 00:27:27,120
Why don't you tell him to come in?

279
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:33,420
Yes, sir.

280
00:27:33,420 --> 00:27:35,670
Are you spying on me now?

281
00:27:35,670 --> 00:27:40,470
I don't like the way you're keeping an eye on me.

282
00:27:40,470 --> 00:27:43,410
Do I need to disappear completely,

283
00:27:43,410 --> 00:27:45,250
so you can stop harassing me?

284
00:27:45,250 --> 00:27:46,890
Driver.

285
00:27:46,890 --> 00:27:50,000
If what you did today happens again.

286
00:28:11,180 --> 00:28:12,450
Hey, I was just worried...

287
00:28:12,450 --> 00:28:16,250
Sorry, it's my fault.

288
00:28:16,250 --> 00:28:19,740
I told you to make things right.

289
00:28:19,740 --> 00:28:21,280
Never mind. Come home.

290
00:28:21,280 --> 00:28:26,100
Bring Ahn Do Hoon here tomorrow.

291
00:28:26,100 --> 00:28:28,600
Yes, sir.

292
00:28:40,530 --> 00:28:45,060
You got promoted thanks to me. Shouldn't you be thanking me?

293
00:28:45,060 --> 00:28:50,020
Thanks to you, I've become busy. I have to go to my office to work.

294
00:28:50,020 --> 00:28:52,060
Really?

295
00:28:52,060 --> 00:28:53,800
Good.

296
00:28:53,800 --> 00:28:57,510
Ah! Don't worry about Kang Yoo Jung.

297
00:28:57,510 --> 00:29:00,600
I made sure that she was okay.

298
00:29:00,600 --> 00:29:06,640
Yoo Jung isn't that kind of woman you can play with.

299
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:08,240
Me?

300
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,000
No.

301
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:13,860
I'm taking care of her.

302
00:29:13,860 --> 00:29:16,230
Besides,

303
00:29:17,430 --> 00:29:22,450
Do I need your permission to decide how I treat her?

304
00:29:22,450 --> 00:29:24,960
I thought you two had broken up.

305
00:29:24,960 --> 00:29:30,330
Are you afraid that something would happen if I keep on seeing her?

306
00:29:33,260 --> 00:29:38,540
Haterd can turn into love.

307
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:42,860
She's an interesting girl.

308
00:29:53,450 --> 00:29:59,900
I won't listen to anything that has nothing to do with my work.

309
00:29:59,900 --> 00:30:03,160
I seem to waste a lot of your time.

310
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:08,120
While I'm gone, you'll be busy workign for my hotel.

311
00:30:08,120 --> 00:30:10,810
Thank you.

312
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:16,270
Let's start visiting branches in Seoul this afternoon.

313
00:30:16,270 --> 00:30:20,930
With regards to the restaurant business, a guy from headquarters will help you.

314
00:30:20,930 --> 00:30:25,540
Mr. Ahn, I told the security team to let you in.

315
00:30:25,540 --> 00:30:29,520
Have you found the black box records?

316
00:30:34,030 --> 00:30:40,360
I think I can use them when the prosecution wants some proof.

317
00:30:40,710 --> 00:30:44,420
I have a meeting. Excuse me.

318
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:54,040
Sir, Ms. Shin wants to see you at her atelier at 2 o'clock.

319
00:30:54,040 --> 00:30:57,140
Se Yeon.

320
00:31:16,170 --> 00:31:18,170
Did you enjoy your date last night?

321
00:31:19,530 --> 00:31:20,760
Yes.

322
00:31:20,800 --> 00:31:22,510
Good.

323
00:31:24,690 --> 00:31:28,490
I heard you introduced Ahn Do Hoon to manage the hotel.

324
00:31:29,370 --> 00:31:34,500
He worked hard for the K Corporation, that's why the board approved of that.

325
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:36,070
I can't to such a thing on my own.

326
00:31:36,110 --> 00:31:42,080
If you did it to make me angry, it worked.

327
00:31:46,760 --> 00:31:48,090
Why did you want to see me?

328
00:31:48,130 --> 00:31:50,880
Free meals for local children.

329
00:31:50,910 --> 00:31:54,480
I hope your restaurant can help with it.

330
00:31:54,540 --> 00:31:56,240
Sure.

331
00:31:57,740 --> 00:31:58,710
Is that all?

332
00:31:58,750 --> 00:32:01,730
You're trying to do good things. Then let's do it.

333
00:32:01,770 --> 00:32:06,630
The K Hotel will fund the free lunch provided at correctional facilities.

334
00:32:07,490 --> 00:32:08,490
Are you enjoying this?

335
00:32:08,530 --> 00:32:09,150
What?

336
00:32:09,190 --> 00:32:12,130
Giving away free stuff out of sympathy,

337
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:15,670
and trying to feel good about yourself.

338
00:32:16,490 --> 00:32:18,410
What do you want to say?

339
00:32:18,900 --> 00:32:21,290
You and I are both who we are thanks to our parents.

340
00:32:21,290 --> 00:32:23,970
We're no better than them.

341
00:32:23,970 --> 00:32:29,900
Can you deny that you're not using Ahn Do Hoon to get my attention?

342
00:32:29,900 --> 00:32:33,750
Or are you really in love with him?

343
00:32:33,750 --> 00:32:37,280
I don't care who you have a relationship with,

344
00:32:37,280 --> 00:32:38,490
but not Ahn Do Hoon.

345
00:32:38,490 --> 00:32:39,310
Min Hyuk!

346
00:32:39,310 --> 00:32:42,100
Am I wrong?

347
00:32:42,410 --> 00:32:44,560
I know you.

348
00:32:44,560 --> 00:32:49,470
You never give up what you have in your grasp.

349
00:32:49,950 --> 00:32:51,790
Get out!

350
00:32:58,860 --> 00:33:01,550
There's one thing I want to tell you.

351
00:33:01,550 --> 00:33:05,800
If you have somthing to tell me, come to see me. Don't make me come here.

352
00:34:37,950 --> 00:34:44,020
It's true that Jo Min Hyuk's company owns the bakery building.

353
00:34:44,020 --> 00:34:47,520
But he can't sell it because it's the company's property.

354
00:34:47,520 --> 00:34:49,880
I can stop him.

355
00:34:54,770 --> 00:34:56,700
Take it!

356
00:34:56,820 --> 00:34:57,560
Do Hoon.

357
00:34:57,560 --> 00:34:59,500
I said take it!

358
00:34:59,500 --> 00:35:01,420
Pay part of what you owe Min Hyuk.

359
00:35:01,420 --> 00:35:02,670
I'll take care of it.

360
00:35:02,670 --> 00:35:04,970
Can you stop being foolish?

361
00:35:04,970 --> 00:35:08,000
How do you think you can pay him?

362
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:11,590
I work here at night and have another job at daytime.

363
00:35:11,590 --> 00:35:12,830
What kind of job?

364
00:35:12,830 --> 00:35:14,590
I work in a western restaurant.

365
00:35:14,590 --> 00:35:19,130
I can get a promotion if I work hard.

366
00:35:20,540 --> 00:35:25,960
Did you know that Min Hyuk owns that restaurant?

367
00:35:26,090 --> 00:35:26,980
What?

368
00:35:26,980 --> 00:35:30,070
If you want to be fooled with him, then continue.

369
00:35:30,070 --> 00:35:31,500
I didn't know.

370
00:35:31,500 --> 00:35:34,350
Take this money.

371
00:35:34,910 --> 00:35:36,900
I'm not giving it to you for your sake.

372
00:35:36,900 --> 00:35:39,920
I give it to you for my sake.

373
00:35:39,920 --> 00:35:43,690
And I'm begging you. Stay away from Min Hyuk.

374
00:35:43,690 --> 00:35:47,420
He's torturing me because of you.

375
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:52,150
You said we should let each other be free.

376
00:35:52,150 --> 00:35:53,500
Why are you doing this to me?

377
00:35:53,500 --> 00:35:55,710
You make me feel guilty.

378
00:35:55,710 --> 00:35:57,250
When will this end?

379
00:35:57,250 --> 00:36:00,030
When?

380
00:36:29,130 --> 00:36:30,850
Detective Choi?

381
00:36:31,980 --> 00:36:33,540
This is Ahn Do Hoon.

382
00:36:33,540 --> 00:36:34,890
Did you see that bastard?

383
00:36:34,890 --> 00:36:35,940
Shit.

384
00:36:35,940 --> 00:36:37,400
I hated him.

385
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:39,010
He was so ugly.

386
00:36:39,010 --> 00:36:40,360
How can he be so ugly!

387
00:36:40,360 --> 00:36:41,690
Yoo Jung!

388
00:36:41,690 --> 00:36:44,380
- Hello. - Hello.

389
00:36:46,290 --> 00:36:50,710
Ms. Kang Yoo Jung, it's been a while.

390
00:36:51,070 --> 00:36:55,950
Someone reported you for a trademark law violation.

391
00:36:59,240 --> 00:37:02,590
Mr. Ahn Do Hoon from the Legal Team.

392
00:37:02,740 --> 00:37:07,360
Right. He copied some files last week.

393
00:37:07,360 --> 00:37:09,450
What files?

394
00:37:10,490 --> 00:37:16,580
The car records of the executives who worked with Pyeongchang Construction between April and July.

395
00:37:16,930 --> 00:37:18,680
Anything else?

396
00:37:20,210 --> 00:37:22,060
No.

397
00:37:22,890 --> 00:37:25,160
Send those files to me.

398
00:37:25,160 --> 00:37:26,240
Yes, sir.

399
00:37:28,210 --> 00:37:33,450
Your father told me to escort you to the western restaurant.

400
00:37:34,010 --> 00:37:37,330
Let's go.

401
00:37:43,310 --> 00:37:46,620
How long will you keep the blakc box records?

402
00:37:46,620 --> 00:37:49,400
For the executives, we keep them for 5 years.

403
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:51,460
5 years.

404
00:37:53,680 --> 00:37:55,500
5 years.

405
00:38:01,300 --> 00:38:03,270
Wait!

406
00:38:06,450 --> 00:38:09,020
- Hello, Mr. Ahn. - Hello, Mr. Ahn.

407
00:38:12,460 --> 00:38:17,280
Why does Mr. Jo suddenly want the black box backup files?

408
00:38:17,280 --> 00:38:20,510
He said he needed to check something.

409
00:38:20,510 --> 00:38:25,320
Let's do it after dinner. I haven't had lunch, either.

410
00:38:25,660 --> 00:38:30,290
Why do we need to backup black box video files?

411
00:38:30,290 --> 00:38:34,650
All the files were deleted due to a system failure in the past.

412
00:38:43,490 --> 00:38:46,510
I know you're a good worker,

413
00:38:46,510 --> 00:38:52,010
but customers won't like it if police officers keep showing up.

414
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:57,530
Driver! Why aren't you working?

415
00:38:59,680 --> 00:39:01,870
I'm not here to see you.

416
00:39:01,870 --> 00:39:04,020
You didn't know that I owned this place?

417
00:39:04,020 --> 00:39:10,040
I should've quit when I found out.

418
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:12,970
I'm sorry I didn't because I needed the money.

419
00:39:12,970 --> 00:39:15,420
What are you talking about?

420
00:39:27,790 --> 00:39:29,080
Take it.

421
00:39:29,080 --> 00:39:31,750
It's a few months' worth.

422
00:39:33,540 --> 00:39:36,570
Please stop torturing me.

423
00:39:37,420 --> 00:39:38,880
Where did you get this money?

424
00:39:38,880 --> 00:39:41,310
Does it matter?

425
00:39:41,310 --> 00:39:44,010
Just take the money.

426
00:39:44,010 --> 00:39:45,700
What I do to make money

427
00:39:45,700 --> 00:39:47,530
shouldn't concern you.

428
00:39:47,530 --> 00:39:48,410
Hey! Driver!

429
00:39:48,560 --> 00:39:50,470
Please!

430
00:39:50,470 --> 00:39:57,270
Please leave me alone.

431
00:40:02,200 --> 00:40:05,680
Whatever it takes, I'll pay the rest of the debt.

432
00:40:11,080 --> 00:40:13,010
She quit?

433
00:40:14,310 --> 00:40:18,070
Well... She got fired.

434
00:40:20,620 --> 00:40:22,470
A detective came.

435
00:40:22,470 --> 00:40:26,680
The scary looking guy said Yoo Jung was involved in a hit-and-run...

436
00:40:28,600 --> 00:40:33,630
An accident in the past.

437
00:40:33,630 --> 00:40:37,450
The manager told Yoo Jung not to come back.

438
00:40:49,380 --> 00:40:50,870
Ja Yeong.

439
00:40:53,370 --> 00:40:54,910
What happened?

440
00:40:54,910 --> 00:40:56,570
Why are you here so early?

441
00:40:56,570 --> 00:40:57,610
Ja Yeong.

442
00:40:57,610 --> 00:41:00,130
Someone reported us to the police.

443
00:41:00,130 --> 00:41:03,240
How did they find out?

444
00:41:03,240 --> 00:41:05,470
What a bad luck.

445
00:41:05,640 --> 00:41:10,860
It's okay. If we pay a fine, we'll be okay.

446
00:41:10,860 --> 00:41:15,710
Let's sell the rest of the stuff.

447
00:41:15,830 --> 00:41:18,670
When the detectives showed up,

448
00:41:18,670 --> 00:41:21,350
I was worried that if I get arrested again,

449
00:41:21,350 --> 00:41:22,970
I won't be able to see my son for a few years.

450
00:41:22,970 --> 00:41:24,050
Ja Yeong.

451
00:41:24,050 --> 00:41:27,660
Do you want a Xanax? I just bought some.

452
00:41:28,980 --> 00:41:32,050
Sorry, I'm sorry.

453
00:41:32,050 --> 00:41:33,370
Why are you sorry?

454
00:41:33,370 --> 00:41:35,530
It's my fault.

455
00:41:35,530 --> 00:41:39,910
It's my fault. I'm sorry.

456
00:41:47,330 --> 00:41:51,560
The detective who showed up today is a friend of Ahn Do Hoon.

457
00:41:51,560 --> 00:41:54,160
His name is Choi DoHyeong.

458
00:42:44,830 --> 00:42:48,030
Aren't you going to answer it?

459
00:42:57,450 --> 00:43:00,650
I guess the sound scared you.

460
00:43:01,120 --> 00:43:02,240
What are you doing?

461
00:43:02,240 --> 00:43:05,000
That's the quesiton I should ask you.

462
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:08,260
Do Hoon, what are you doing here?

463
00:43:11,160 --> 00:43:14,810
It's glad to see you panic.

464
00:43:15,420 --> 00:43:16,970
Tell me.

465
00:43:16,970 --> 00:43:19,870
Why are you here?

466
00:43:20,480 --> 00:43:22,840
It's about Congressman Shin and President Jo...

467
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:24,570
No more nosense! Tell me

468
00:43:24,570 --> 00:43:27,320
why you're here.

469
00:43:27,320 --> 00:43:30,260
Do you mind if I tell you?

470
00:43:31,170 --> 00:43:34,870
The secret that you're keeping here.

471
00:43:35,950 --> 00:43:37,120
You're trying to stop

472
00:43:37,120 --> 00:43:40,670
the secret from being revealed.

473
00:43:42,500 --> 00:43:43,750
What is it?

474
00:43:43,750 --> 00:43:46,400
That secret.

475
00:43:49,800 --> 00:43:52,840
I have no secret.

476
00:43:52,840 --> 00:43:55,430
I don't know what you're looking for.

477
00:43:55,430 --> 00:43:57,390
Find it if you can.

478
00:43:57,390 --> 00:43:59,060
I will.

479
00:43:59,060 --> 00:44:02,330
No matter how hard you try to protect your secret,

480
00:44:02,330 --> 00:44:06,320
I'll reveal it myself.

481
00:44:54,520 --> 00:44:56,770
Don't you feel regret

482
00:44:56,770 --> 00:44:57,960
kicking Min Hyuk out?

483
00:44:57,960 --> 00:44:59,330
If I was going to regret it,

484
00:44:59,330 --> 00:45:01,950
I wouldn't have done it.

485
00:45:01,950 --> 00:45:03,730
Why did you do that?

486
00:45:03,730 --> 00:45:05,580
Min Hyuk,

487
00:45:05,580 --> 00:45:07,410
he has everything,

488
00:45:07,410 --> 00:45:09,970
so he always ignore me.

489
00:45:09,970 --> 00:45:12,650
If you have Min Hyuk,

490
00:45:12,650 --> 00:45:14,070
will you be happy?

491
00:45:14,070 --> 00:45:15,730
Whatever it takes,

492
00:45:15,730 --> 00:45:17,810
I want to have him.

493
00:45:17,810 --> 00:45:19,820
I can help you,

494
00:45:19,820 --> 00:45:22,250
if you want.

495
00:45:22,900 --> 00:45:25,950
Everthing he has,

496
00:45:25,950 --> 00:45:28,010
I'll take away from him.

497
00:45:28,010 --> 00:45:33,190
Why do you want to destroy him so badly?

498
00:45:33,460 --> 00:45:37,550
Has anything ever happened between you two?

499
00:45:41,600 --> 00:45:44,730
You sent this to the board, right?

500
00:45:44,730 --> 00:45:47,760
This is the same file that you were checking into

501
00:45:47,760 --> 00:45:50,270
regarding our gallery's transactions.

502
00:45:50,270 --> 00:45:51,760
Well...

503
00:45:51,760 --> 00:45:55,200
I didn't tell Min Hyuk about this.

504
00:45:55,740 --> 00:46:01,200
Does the world look different from the top?

505
00:46:01,200 --> 00:46:04,200
I'm not sure.

506
00:46:05,640 --> 00:46:08,860
But I want to find out,

507
00:46:13,880 --> 00:46:19,940
how high I should go up for you to hold my hand.

508
00:46:20,270 --> 00:46:23,350
I don't know.

509
00:46:23,640 --> 00:46:27,370
Go as high as you can.

510
00:46:27,950 --> 00:46:31,410
I'd destroy him

511
00:46:31,410 --> 00:46:35,470
if I can't have him.

512
00:46:37,470 --> 00:46:38,280
I'll introduce Mr. Ahn Do Hoon

513
00:46:38,280 --> 00:46:40,470
from the legal team of K Corporation

514
00:46:40,470 --> 00:46:41,800
to replace our former CEO Mr. Jo Min Hyuk

515
00:46:41,800 --> 00:46:47,350
to manage the hotle.

516
00:46:55,210 --> 00:46:57,510
Hello, I'm Ahn Do Hoon.

517
00:46:57,510 --> 00:46:59,640
Yes, sir.

518
00:46:59,930 --> 00:47:02,950
Yes. I have taken care of it.

519
00:47:03,540 --> 00:47:05,010
Yes. Don't worry.

520
00:47:05,010 --> 00:47:07,460
I'll take care of it.

521
00:47:07,460 --> 00:47:09,530
Yes.

522
00:47:10,840 --> 00:47:12,890
Where is my father?

523
00:47:12,890 --> 00:47:17,090
He's checking his schedule for his upcoming trip to Germany next week.

524
00:47:18,470 --> 00:47:21,330
He comes out again?

525
00:47:21,330 --> 00:47:23,850
What are you doing here?

526
00:47:24,670 --> 00:47:26,960
Nothing special.

527
00:47:26,960 --> 00:47:30,540
I want to held a tasting event at the Limondleang western restaurant.

528
00:47:30,540 --> 00:47:32,920
I want to ask his opinion.

529
00:47:32,920 --> 00:47:35,730
It's good to see you working hard.

530
00:47:35,730 --> 00:47:38,930
He'll be happy to see his heir working hard.

531
00:47:38,930 --> 00:47:40,660
His heir?

532
00:47:40,660 --> 00:47:42,510
He takes every good thing.

533
00:47:42,510 --> 00:47:45,740
I got nothing even I'm his heir.

534
00:47:46,040 --> 00:47:48,190
Just work hard.

535
00:47:48,190 --> 00:47:50,160
The girl that you care about,

536
00:47:50,160 --> 00:47:52,840
is she okay?

537
00:48:13,920 --> 00:48:16,070
Driver! Driver!

538
00:48:16,070 --> 00:48:19,160
How can you go to my house as you wish?

539
00:48:19,390 --> 00:48:21,040
- Shit. - Where is Kang Yoo Jung?

540
00:48:21,040 --> 00:48:22,970
You shouldn't break into my house like this.

541
00:48:22,970 --> 00:48:25,720
Kang Yoo Jung!

542
00:48:33,940 --> 00:48:35,230
Where is Yoo Jung?

543
00:48:35,230 --> 00:48:37,300
Why are you asking me?

544
00:48:37,300 --> 00:48:40,600
She ran away to get away from you.

545
00:48:56,350 --> 00:48:58,720
Driver!

546
00:49:18,330 --> 00:49:21,460
Let's have a talk!

547
00:49:26,950 --> 00:49:29,800
Why are you asking me that?

548
00:49:29,800 --> 00:49:31,760
After Kang Yoo Jung got out of my restaurant,

549
00:49:31,760 --> 00:49:35,060
she gave me a large amount of money.

550
00:49:36,800 --> 00:49:39,110
She called me the other day.

551
00:49:39,110 --> 00:49:40,910
She seemed to be scared of you,

552
00:49:40,910 --> 00:49:43,610
so I helped her.

553
00:49:43,610 --> 00:49:45,130
That's all.

554
00:49:45,130 --> 00:49:46,440
As you know,

555
00:49:46,440 --> 00:49:48,310
I have nothing to do with her.

556
00:49:48,310 --> 00:49:51,970
Then why do you act like you have somethign to do with her?

557
00:49:51,970 --> 00:49:53,410
What do you mean?

558
00:49:53,410 --> 00:49:54,690
You know better than me

559
00:49:54,690 --> 00:49:58,270
what you are trying to hide.

560
00:49:58,270 --> 00:50:00,170
I wonder

561
00:50:00,170 --> 00:50:05,360
if you can hide that secret forever.

562
00:50:10,600 --> 00:50:14,100
You look anxious,

563
00:50:14,730 --> 00:50:19,770
I don't think you want to find her because of the accident.

564
00:50:19,770 --> 00:50:21,970
Are you bored

565
00:50:21,970 --> 00:50:24,880
since your toy's gone?

566
00:50:29,090 --> 00:50:31,640
If you have nothing else to say,

567
00:50:31,640 --> 00:50:34,650
please excuse me.

568
00:50:37,580 --> 00:50:40,100
Hello. This is Ahn Do Hoon.

569
00:50:40,100 --> 00:50:43,370
Sure.

570
00:50:43,370 --> 00:50:47,010
Go ahead.

571
00:51:10,310 --> 00:51:13,710
Kang Yoo Jung! Where are you now?

572
00:51:17,490 --> 00:51:24,400
Find the bank that Yoo Jung transferred money today.

573
00:51:25,610 --> 00:51:29,540
- Then search the area nearby. - Yes, sir.

574
00:51:45,790 --> 00:51:47,840
Aren't you painting these days?

575
00:51:47,840 --> 00:51:50,100
I don't feel like painting these days.

576
00:51:52,410 --> 00:51:55,470
What did you and Min Hyuk talk about?

577
00:51:56,770 --> 00:52:00,110
Is that why you wanted to see me?

578
00:52:02,770 --> 00:52:09,520
He was looking for Kang Yoo Jung. I don't think he cared about you now.

579
00:52:10,600 --> 00:52:14,970
He just didn't want someone else to have you.

580
00:52:16,750 --> 00:52:23,220
Am I not good enough for you?

581
00:52:26,480 --> 00:52:29,740
If I go higher,

582
00:52:30,460 --> 00:52:33,280
will you give me a chance?

583
00:52:44,370 --> 00:52:47,540
Due to denfendant Kang Yoo Jung's irresponsible act,

584
00:52:47,540 --> 00:52:50,390
a young woman and

585
00:52:50,390 --> 00:52:55,640
her unborn child were dead.

586
00:52:56,160 --> 00:53:08,700
Therefore, we presecutor ask for a five-year sentence to defendant Kang Yoo Jung.

587
00:53:14,560 --> 00:53:19,410
San, say thank you to the prosecutor.

588
00:53:56,720 --> 00:54:04,170
What do you want to do?

589
00:55:15,990 --> 00:55:20,880
- Bye. - Bye.

590
00:55:23,890 --> 00:55:25,720
Driver.

591
00:55:32,590 --> 00:55:34,460
What makes you scared and hide from me?

592
00:55:34,460 --> 00:55:36,750
I'm not hiding.

593
00:55:39,770 --> 00:55:42,630
I'm here to find a job.

594
00:55:42,630 --> 00:55:46,980
I'm not scared and hide from you,

595
00:55:47,620 --> 00:55:50,710
I just can't bear to see you anymore.

596
00:55:50,710 --> 00:55:55,470
- Yoo Jung, are you done? - Yes. Have a good night.

597
00:55:55,470 --> 00:55:59,370
- You, too. - I'll see you tomorrow.

598
00:56:02,070 --> 00:56:04,310
Bye.

599
00:56:06,550 --> 00:56:13,070
Don't smile. Don't smile in front of other people.

600
00:56:26,890 --> 00:56:30,950
- Hello. - Hello.

601
00:56:51,820 --> 00:56:56,130
Hello. Good morning.

602
00:56:56,130 --> 00:56:59,020
I'm hungry. Give me some food.

603
00:57:08,100 --> 00:57:11,070
It's too early. Get out.

604
00:57:11,070 --> 00:57:13,820
- I'll wait until it's ready. - What are you doing?

605
00:57:13,820 --> 00:57:15,950
I'm hungry.

606
00:57:32,590 --> 00:57:36,440
- Hello. - Hello.

607
00:57:36,440 --> 00:57:39,120
- Enjoy your meal. - Over here. - Yes.

608
00:57:39,120 --> 00:57:42,170
- One more bowl of rice. - Okay.

609
00:57:42,560 --> 00:57:46,510
- Give me a bowl. - Yes.

610
00:57:48,600 --> 00:57:53,190
Get out! Get out!

611
00:58:06,530 --> 00:58:12,510
I said I'd pay you back. I'm working to pay you back.

612
00:58:12,510 --> 00:58:15,140
Why are you harassing me like this?

613
00:58:15,140 --> 00:58:17,650
Are you going to tell them that I'm a murderer?

614
00:58:17,650 --> 00:58:19,190
Do you want them to kick me out?

615
00:58:19,190 --> 00:58:21,550
Why are you doing this to me?

616
00:58:21,550 --> 00:58:24,060
Do you think I'm that kind of person?

617
00:58:25,910 --> 00:58:35,190
Okay. Anyway, come back with me.

618
00:58:38,660 --> 00:58:42,090
Let me go! Let me go!

619
00:58:42,090 --> 00:58:47,480
- Let's go back. - Let me go! Are you crazy?

620
00:58:47,480 --> 00:58:53,710
Yes, I'm crazy. I'm crazy missing you. Stay with me.

621
00:59:09,700 --> 00:59:16,020
Next on Secret Love.

622
00:59:16,020 --> 00:59:19,230
Fire Ahn Do Hoon right away.

623
00:59:19,230 --> 00:59:20,340
What are you doing?

624
00:59:20,340 --> 00:59:23,480
As long as you stay with me, I won't fire him.

625
00:59:23,720 --> 00:59:26,390
Mr. Jo wants you to work at his house today.

626
00:59:26,600 --> 00:59:28,740
Did you touch other files in the Security Room?

627
00:59:28,740 --> 00:59:30,880
Min Hyuk ordered the tech team to recover it.

628
00:59:30,880 --> 00:59:35,140
Jo Min Hyuk is reinvestigating your case. Is that you?

629
00:59:35,140 --> 00:59:37,830
Is this from your store?

630
00:59:37,830 --> 00:59:39,750
Your father looked good.

631
00:59:39,750 --> 00:59:42,450
Some guy took him.
